    "updated_at": "2018-04-19T06:01:59Z",
    "body": "You don't want to validate. If something is a number instead of a string, what you most likely want is to ignore that member and not have it in your returned data structure. As some kind of forward-compatible \"error\" handling.\r\n\r\nAnd yeah, that would mean defining yet another schema/IDL of sorts.",
